            "creator": "bzbarsky@mit.edu",
            "timestamp": "2007-10-25T14:25:17Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "*** Bug 421193 has been marked as a duplicate of this bug. ***",
            "creator": "alqahira@ardisson.org",
            "timestamp": "2008-03-05T23:53:41Z"
        },
        {
