{
    "bug_id": 10158,
    "summary": "[key]HTML:INPUT not properly handling some event handlers",
    "comments": [
        {
            "text": "HTML:INPUT does consistantly handle event handlers across platforms.  onkeydown\ndoes not seem to work on the Mac.  onkeypress works differently on Mac vs Windows\nand not at all on Linux (on Mac the value of this field includes the new key when\nonkeypress fires, but on Windows the value includes the data prior to this key\npress, on Linux it never fires).\n\nI separated this bug from 10054 because that one is the fix we need most urgently\nand therefore it is marked as a blocker.",
            "creator": "hangas@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-07-19T23:24:26Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Oops, the bug I meant to refer to above was 10154.",
            "creator": "hangas@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-07-19T23:26:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Layout or JS, rickg?",
            "creator": "mcafee@gmail.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-07-21T07:27:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Vidur -- you may be interested in this one",
            "creator": "rickg@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-07-22T04:53:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Created attachment 1216\nFor your viewing pleasure, an event viewer for <INPUT>",
            "creator": "mdubinko@yahoo.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-12T07:16:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "I left out onMouseMove(), it filled the display too fast! Anyway, here's an easy\nway to test how the different platforms react to events.",
            "creator": "mdubinko@yahoo.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-12T07:19:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Is this an event bug, or one related to other keypress/keyup/keydown stuff I've\nheard talk of in various newsgroups?",
            "creator": "mike.shaver@gmail.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-16T18:27:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Pierre, can you take a look at the Mac specific portions of this bug, then\nreassign as appropriate?  Thanks.",
            "creator": "pollmann@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-16T20:33:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Marking blocker per comment from hangas when he opened the bug.\nReassigning to tague who is handling these issues.",
            "creator": "pierre@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-21T22:47:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Hangas said that he marked 10154 as a blocker. Is *this* bug (10158) supposed\nto be a blocker?",
            "creator": "erik@vanderpoel.org",
            "timestamp": "1999-10-07T22:22:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Mail Compose and Address Book need this fixed for beta.  Specifically we need\nonkeypress= to fire properly for all platforms.  The other event handlers are not\nas urgent.",
            "creator": "hangas@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-10-07T22:28:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Frank has offered to look into this one. Reassigning to ftang.",
            "creator": "erik@vanderpoel.org",
            "timestamp": "1999-10-07T22:35:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "fix in keyEvent_19991004_BRANCH landing",
            "creator": "ftang@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-10-14T20:11:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "qa contact to gerardok, looks like his group",
            "creator": "paulmac@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-12-02T04:32:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Verified with 2000-12-15. with Linux as well as win-95.",
            "creator": "desale@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "2000-07-13T23:18:21Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Pushed by ctuns@mozilla.com:\nhttps://hg.mozilla.org/integration/autoland/rev/8951ab143193\n[components] Closes https://github.com/mozilla-mobile/android-components/issues/10158: Fix list_compatible_dependency_versions.py",
            "creator": "pulsebot@bmo.tld",
            "timestamp": "2024-03-18T17:54:49Z"
        }
    ]
}

