            "text": "prelim sched say rpotts should get this.\n- work with proxies (rick, 1w)\n   - autoconfig (rick, 1w)",
            "creator": "chofmann@gmail.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-07-29T14:45:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "bug 8559 has lots of the nitty gritty details about proxy bustage",
            "creator": "paulmac@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-07-31T00:26:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Updating QA Contact.",
            "creator": "leger@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-24T03:35:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "*** Bug 12681 has been marked as a duplicate of this bug. ***",
            "creator": "paulmac@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-27T21:14:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "*** Bug 13231 has been marked as a duplicate of this bug. ***",
            "creator": "ian@hixie.ch",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-07T17:16:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "The following bugs also address proxy issues:\n   bug 6540 (prefs front end).\n   bug 8559 (pref callback problem).\n   bug 7398 (where to store the prefs).",
            "creator": "ian@hixie.ch",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-07T17:20:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Checked in. (no autoconfig as yet)",
            "creator": "gagan@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-20T07:54:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Could someone tell me how I can enable proxy support in the current build? Do I\nhave to wait for autoconfig to support a --enable-proxy option, or is there\nanother way? This is blocking me from testing some of my bugs. Thanks.",
            "creator": "mark.lin@eng.sun.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-21T00:53:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Adding info that Mark Lin found on his own, so that others who need the\nfunctionality from this bug can use it as well: to turn on proxy support, append\nthe following two lines to your .netscape/mozProfile/prefs.js file:\n\nuser_pref(\"network.proxy.http\", \"myProxyHost.myCompany.com\");\nuser_pref(\"network.proxy.http_port\", 8080);",
            "creator": "drapeau@eng.sun.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-22T22:21:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "I verified this on Mac/Linux/Windows. This will make a lot of people happy.\nEventually we will have to respect the http.proxy.type pref also.",
            "creator": "paulmac@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-09-23T04:12:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Bulk move of all Necko (to be deleted component) bugs to new Networking\n\ncomponent.",
            "creator": "leger@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-12-14T00:36:59Z"
        }
    ]
}

