        },
        {
            "text": "verified worksforme",
            "creator": "jaymoz@gmail.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-07-28T20:35:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Build 7/30/99\n\nThis bug still crashes for me.\n\nTalkback Incident ID = 11927393\nCall Stack:    (Signature = 0x0012fe6c 17a3bc81)\n0x0012fe6c\n\nhttp://cyclone/reports/incidenttemplate.CFM?reportID=124&style=0&tc=9&cp=1&ck1=S\nUser+email+address&cd1=%25jimmylee%40netscape%2Ecom%25&co1=like&bbid=11927393",
