        {
            "text": "reopen bug.\nbacking out changes ringt now.\n\nwe need ways to convert nstrings to UTF8 strings (bug 12428)\nand sprintf support for unichar strings (bug 12430)",
            "creator": "cathleennscp@netscape.net",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-24T23:55:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "setting target milestone to M15\nlooks like the depending suport won't be in till later...",
            "creator": "cathleennscp@netscape.net",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-24T23:58:59Z"
