        {
            "text": "Clearing Fixed resolution due to reopen.",
            "creator": "leger@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-25T00:11:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Bulk move of XPInstall (component to be deleted) bugs to Installer: XPInstall\nEngine",
            "creator": "leger@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-12-08T23:28:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "reassign to dveditz\nset to M17\nbug meeting 3/20",
            "creator": "cathleennscp@netscape.net",
            "timestamp": "2000-03-20T22:02:06Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "changes will affect strings output.\nQA would like to see this get in early rather than later because it would be \nhard for them to test.",
            "creator": "cathleennscp@netscape.net",
            "timestamp": "2000-05-08T18:45:08Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Putting on [NEED INFO] radar.  Can someone explain impace to user and why a \nbeta2 blocker please?  Thanks!",
            "creator": "leger@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "2000-05-08T23:28:28Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "This bug prevents localization of XPInstall into double-byte languages (e.g. \nJapanese). In addition fixing this would require a fair amount of internal API \nchanging and it seemed better to take the hit now.\n\nIf you can live with it, I can live with it--but CC'ing i18n folks to get their \ninput :-)",
            "creator": "dveditz@mozilla.com",
            "timestamp": "2000-05-08T23:56:07Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Spoke with dveditz. Putting on [nsbeta2-] radar. Not critical to beta2.",
            "creator": "leger@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "2000-05-09T22:50:32Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "These won't make 6.0 for sure",
            "creator": "dveditz@mozilla.com",
            "timestamp": "2000-08-12T04:34:53Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Is there any one working on this? Two bugs this bug depends on have been fixed a\nlong time ago. Cathleen, can you resurrect your check-ins? Well, I can do\n'code-achaelogoy'...\nSee also bug 12574 comment #11\n\n\n",
            "creator": "jshin1987@gmail.com",
            "timestamp": "2004-03-19T11:00:04Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "The xpinstall script engine has been removed from the trunk, bugs in it are obsolete.",
            "creator": "dveditz@mozilla.com",
            "timestamp": "2008-03-16T06:34:45Z"
        }
    ]
}

