            "timestamp": "1999-07-20T22:29:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "I have made numberous bug fixes which might cause some of these bugs to go away.\n I am going to mark them as FIXED so that they may be verified.",
            "creator": "doug.turner@gmail.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-07-21T18:14:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Build 7/22/99\n\nThis bug is similar to Bug 9743.  See this bug for specific jar file used.  Both\nWindows and Macintosh are behaving as expected for this specific test.  Linux is\nfailing.  The Install.log shows:\n\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nhttp://jimbob/jars/a_compareversion_2_string.jar     --     07/22/1999\n12:28:53\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------\nAcceptance: a_compareversion_2_string\n\nItem [1/1] Installing:\n/u/jimmylee/linux60/jul_22/package/a_compareversion_2_string/smrtupdt.txt\n\nInstall completed successfully\n** CompareVersion should return -4 = 0\nFinished Installation  07/22/1999 12:28:53\n\nAdding [PP] to Summary since it is now platform specific.  Also, OS has been\nchanged from All to Linux.  Bug 9743 will be marked Verified when this bug is\nmarked Verified.",
            "creator": "jimmykenlee@yahoo.com",
