        {
            "text": "wont have time for this bug for M7...",
            "creator": "bugzilla@ducarroz.org",
            "timestamp": "1999-06-14T21:24:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Hmm, is this really true? The focus and typing go into the address field for me,\nat least on windows.",
