{
    "bug_id": 11371,
    "summary": "{compat} Image layout is not correct (css2 line layout issue)",
    "comments": [
        {
            "text": "In HTML, I often use the following technique to get two images to put together\nvertically :\n\n<a href=\"...\"><img src=h1.jpg border=\"0\"></a><br>\n<img src=h2.jpg border=\"0\">\n\nBut in M8(even the earlier version), whatever the viewer or the apprunner always\nput 4px-wide spacing between h1.jpg and h2.jpg. Unless I delete the <a href></a>\nfrom img h1.jpg, like the following:\n\n<img src=h1.jpg border=\"0\"><br>\n<img src=h2.jpg border=\"0\">\n\nThen, it will display like what I expect.\n\nI try this within many web pages, if the image tag is contained within the\n<a href> tag, then the images never stick together(but, the horizontal imaeges\ndose stick together). There are always some spacing between them.\nbetween them.",
            "creator": "cathy@mitux.tatung.com.tw",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-06T05:36:53Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Inserting Summary since it was left blank.  Clearing milestone.  Cathy, please so\nnot fill this in when submitting a bug.  That is the targeted milestone for the\nbug to be set by the engineering mgr for this component.  Thanks!",
            "creator": "leger@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-06T17:16:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "This is a nice simple case of css2 vs. nav4 compatability",
            "creator": "kipp@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-08T13:43:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Well, this is a duplicate of bug #5821\nBut it has M10 as target milestone.\nSo, I'm marking this a duplicate AND set 5821 to M10.\n\n\n*** This bug has been marked as a duplicate of 5821 ***",
            "creator": "hyp-x@inf.bme.hu",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-08T16:52:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Agreed. Marking this a verified duplicate.",
            "creator": "chrispetersen@mac.com",
            "timestamp": "1999-08-11T20:37:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Pushed by ctuns@mozilla.com:\nhttps://hg.mozilla.org/integration/autoland/rev/3ff3f71f91a8\n[fenix] For https://github.com/mozilla-mobile/fenix/issues/11371 - Fix for Dynamic Download Dialog",
            "creator": "pulsebot@bmo.tld",
            "timestamp": "2024-03-18T18:23:21Z"
        }
    ]
}

