        },
        {
            "text": "sorry for the spam.  making bugzilla reflect reality as I'm not working on these bugs.  filter on FOOBARCHEESE to remove these in bulk.",
            "creator": "moco@sspitzer.org",
            "timestamp": "2007-06-21T21:21:02Z"
        },
        {
