{
    "bug_id": 16959,
    "summary": "RFE: Bookmark provider",
    "comments": [
        {
            "text": "Request to implement bookmark provider.\n\nWhat are bookmark provider ?\nA bookmark provider should behave like a servlet, creating dynamic content\ninstead of static one.\nThe provider can be set as a subfolder in the bookmarks, and any access to\nbrowse it's content will result in that the bookmark code will generate\nbookmarks&folders automatically.\n\nUsage:\n- can be used to access IE-bookmarks with dynamic r/w-access (instead of a\nsloppy \"convert\" tool)\n- can be used to access CDE(Solaris 7) bookmarks (which are organized as single\nfiles&dirs instead of a single bookmark file)\n- can be used for collaborative bookmarking; a bookmark provider simply links to\na shared bookmark file and handles file locking",
            "creator": "roland.mainz@nrubsig.org",
            "timestamp": "1999-10-21T13:11:20Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Guessing XPApps. Claudius?",
            "creator": "elig@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "1999-10-28T17:26:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "> M20\nThis is a BAD joke, isn't it ?\nWe need this for CDE/KDE integration...",
            "creator": "roland.mainz@nrubsig.org",
            "timestamp": "1999-12-13T15:56:59Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Added RFE/Bug 24829 (\"bookmarks as icons\"). Best would be to handle the\ndatabase/storing issue here...\n",
            "creator": "roland.mainz@nrubsig.org",
            "timestamp": "2000-01-23T20:18:57Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Move to \"Future\" milestone.\n",
            "creator": "don@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "2000-05-25T20:59:10Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "\nSince Don has left, Vishy is taking his bugs in bulk, pending reassignment.\nthanks,\n\tVishy",
            "creator": "vishy@formerly-netscape.com.tld",
            "timestamp": "2000-12-06T19:24:53Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "nav triage team:\n\nSorry, Roland, don't think we'll have time for this in beta1, though this would \nsolve #$#%^# IE Favorites issues. Marking nsbeta1-, adding HW",
            "creator": "paulkchen@netscape.net",
            "timestamp": "2000-12-29T22:05:11Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "When do we have time for this ??",
            "creator": "roland.mainz@nrubsig.org",
            "timestamp": "2001-01-01T20:17:27Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "--> Ben",
            "creator": "bugzilla@blakeross.com",
            "timestamp": "2001-05-30T04:36:55Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "This is possible already with the magic of RDF. Use your imagination!\n\nSearch, FTP view, File view, etc already work this way. \n\nIf you want a specific datasource (for, say, CDE bookmarks) file a bug on that \nspecific issue. Don't file it against me if it's not about our core \nimplementation, file against yourself or nobody@mozilla.org",
            "creator": "bugs@bengoodger.com",
            "timestamp": "2001-10-03T06:53:39Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "mass-verifying Invalid bugs which haven't changed since 2001-12-31.\n\nuse the search string \"PinballWizard\" if you want to filter out this msg.",
            "creator": "bugzilla@iwaruna.com",
            "timestamp": "2002-12-18T01:04:44Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Pushed by ffxbld-merge:\nhttps://hg.mozilla.org/releases/mozilla-beta/rev/db778481f428\n[fenix] For https://github.com/mozilla-mobile/fenix/issues/16959: verify page url not content in swipeToSwitchTabTest",
            "creator": "pulsebot@bmo.tld",
            "timestamp": "2024-04-15T08:27:47Z"
        }
    ]
