            "timestamp": "2003-10-02T02:16:15Z"
        },
        {
            "text": "Pushed by ffxbld-merge:\nhttps://hg.mozilla.org/releases/mozilla-beta/rev/6652b13578f2\n[fenix] For https://github.com/mozilla-mobile/fenix/issues/18287 - Display a credit card autofill prompt (https://github.com/mozilla-mobile/fenix/pull/19477)",
            "creator": "pulsebot@bmo.tld",
